	measure '_$DI Early/LateDirectPO' = ```
			
			VAR Diff =
			    [_$DICalcArravDate MAGIC_Lookup] - MAX('FACT Future'[Requested deliv.date])
			RETURN
			    IF(
			        ISBLANK(Diff),
			        "N/A",
			        IF(
			            Diff > 7,
			            "Late",
			            IF(
			                Diff < -7,
			                "Early",
			                "On Time"
			            )
			        )
			    )
			
			```
		lineageTag: 27bbb02c-aaeb-49ec-b63e-83ee2cb71f99

