	measure _$excesscogs(12month) = ```
			/*( [_$Excess(12mo)]*[_$standardprice])*/
			
			SUMX(
			    SUMMARIZE(
			        'FACT Future',
			        'DIM Product'[Material],
			        'DIM MRP Area'[MRP Area]
			    ),
			    VAR Excess =
			        CALCULATE([_$Excess(12mo)])
			    VAR Price =
			        CALCULATE([_$standardprice])
			    RETURN
			        IF(
			            Excess > 0 &&
			            NOT ISBLANK(Price),
			            Excess * Price,
			            0
			        )
			)
			
			
			```
		lineageTag: 4896b735-fc73-4cf1-bcb4-c7cf05c2c40f

